  "title": "Curri unveil its new integration with Epicor Eclipse, a premier ERP system for the industry.",
  "summary": "Curri uses the native freight estimation tools in Eclipse to enable quoting and booking of rush delivery directly out of a sales order or purchase order. This integration simplifies the logistics process by enabling Eclipse users to book Curri deliveries directly from their ERP dashboard, and is 100% free to install.",
